:: Carter Yard Play Tag [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
As the two of you are deciding what to play, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> suddenly taps you in the side. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Tag! You’re it!”</span> He laughs before running away, <span style="Color: Yellow">declaring war against you.</span> You give chase as the boy dives up the slide of the jungle gym, scurrying to the top like a mouse. You follow behind, but can’t get as good of footing as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> races down the other side out of reach. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, you won’t catch me!”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You continue to chase <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> throughout the yard, his small body and surprising speed keeping him out of your grasp. However, as you corner him and he has no choice but to escape via the concrete area next to the pool, <span style="Color: Yellow">he suddenly holds his hands up and shouts.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hold on a second!”</span> You freeze, staring at him in confusion as he points to the pool. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No running near the pool, that’s super dangerous.”</span> He says, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So only speed walking around here, okay? Better safe than sorry.”</span> <br>
<br>
You can’t help but smile at how dorky the boy is, but agree to his demands. <span style="Color: LightGreen">This leads to a rather funny speedwalking chase around the edge of the pool that ends with you finally managing to tag <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> when he loses his balance, stumbling in place. Your tag is the final push he needs to fall into the pool.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s cheating!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> declares as he resurfaces, but you are already running back to the jungle gym to safety. <span style="Color: LightGreen">The rest of the game is a fun back and forth where you both use the pool to escape each other multiple times.</span> <br>
<span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
<span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
<<needChange "Fun" 10>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
<br>
[[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
